vailable","mentions":[],"name":"Confrontation shi'ar","officialText":"Si ce personnage a moins de 50 % de vie :\n> Donne une Barrière de 30 % de la vie max. de ce personnage.\n> Génère 3 énergie(s) de capacité ultime pour soi.\n\nRend 50 % de la vie max. de ce personnage. Rend 40 % de la vie max. de ce personnage à tous les alliés Annihilateurs.\n\nAttaque la cible principale et inflige 400 % de dégâts. Cette attaque obtient +30 % de chances de critique.\n\nSi ce personnage a plus de 50 % de vie :\n> Réduit la jauge de vitesse de la cible principale de 50 %.\n> Obtient Provocation pendant 2 tours et Immunité pendant 2 tours.","operations":[{"abilityId":"abl_eb6465dd7084eb49","abilityType":"ultimate","actionOrder":6,"chance":null,"characterId":"Gladiator","conditions":["Vie du personnage supérieur ou égal à 50 %"],"effect":{"label":"Provocation","mechanicId":"taunt","resolved":true,"sourceName":"Taunt"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_51be0e9f0bd893ab","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["taunt"],"metrics":[{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":2},{"key":"applyCount","label":"Nombre d’applications","unit":null,"value":2}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":"allié","trigger":null},{"abilityId":"abl_eb6465dd7084eb49","abilityType":"ultimate","actionOrder":6,"chance":null,"characterId":"Gladiator","conditions":["Vie du personnage supérieur ou égal à 50 %"],"effect":{"label":"Immunité","mechanicId":"debuff-block","resolved":true,"sourceName":"DebuffBlock"},"evidence":"normalized","id":"op_63102ea63ca491c3","kind":"effect_apply","kindLabel":"Applique","mechanicIds":["debuff-block"],"metrics":[{"key":"useCount","label":"Quantité indiquée","unit":null,"value":2},{"key":"applyCount","label":"Nombre d’applications","unit":null,"value":2}],"modes":[],"scope":"Cible de l’action","sides":[],"sourceType":"proc","target":"allié","trigger":null}],"parentAbilityId":null,"presentationStat